 workplace gossip, passive-aggressive managers, and sabotaged collaborative projects.
📿 Daily Practice: Sun Beej Mantra (108 reps) & worship Lord Surya & Lord Vishnu.
🎯 Success Key: maintain documented email trails, communicate purely on merit, and decline informal office rumour sessions.', `astrological_remedies` = '📿 Vedic Mantra Chanting: Chant the Sun Beej Mantra ''Om Hram Hreem Hroum Sah Suryaya Namah'' 108 times daily using a japa mala to fortify vital energy.

🪔 Prescribed Temple Pooja: Organize or participate in Workplace Ganesh Puja dedicated to Lord Surya & Lord Vishnu to clear karmic hurdles.

